WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.570
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:44.350
You poor girl. What have you
been put through up to now?

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:52.090
I'm not trying to trick you.
From now on, I'll protect you. Don't cry.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.640
Y- you're!

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:20.420
l'm back!

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:28.560
"'Black Girl"'

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:34.970
"'MenMon Girlfriend Finalized!!"'
"'Kashiwagi Sae-chan, 15"'

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.300
"'Special Edition: This is who Sae-chan is"'

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.600
"'A peek into her private life"'

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.200
I'm sorry, let me pass.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.320
Unbelievable! Can this really be?

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.660
She's gotten her big break overnight.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.590
Right now, the whole campus
has a slight case of Sae mania.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.590
She really is cute, huh?

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.930
Don't you think her personality
has improved lately?

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.770
All at once, the boys who
had washed their hands of Sae

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:12.270
were joining her camp of supporters.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.940
l even heard that in the higher grades,
they had started a fan club.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.940
And as for the girl in question...

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:20.610
Good morning!

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:24.950
I got to keep the wig I used at the
photo shoot. Does it look good on me?

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.950
--It does, it does!
--It does, it does!
--It does, it does!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.950
lt's really tacky.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.960
Say, let's take a purikura photo together.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:35.290
They're being fooled.
They're definitely being fooled!

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:39.750
They're making such a fuss over her, l hope
her personality doesn't rebound as well.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.970
I'm getting tired of all this commotion.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:48.310
Everywhere I go, it's "'Sae-chan, Sae-chan."'

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.240
Everyone had been excluding her,

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.940
but the moment she becomes a model,
they all turn around just like that.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.310
It's ridiculous.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.980
No doubt she's letting it go to her head.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.920
I wonder if Momo-chan is all right.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.920
What is it he sees in her?

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.590
Jigoro is less of a man for this.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.960
Well, actually,
maybe he's the consummate man.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:10.590
He does get to go out with Sae-chan,
after all.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:15.270
Man, this guy is sexy. I can see
why the girls are nuts about him.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:20.270
Say, which guy would you prefer,
Jigoro or myself?

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.940
Kairi, that would be you, obviously!

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:26.610
We saw him in person the other day,
and he's no big deal.

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:28.950
He's got the same good looks
you can find anywhere.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.950
Oh? So this kind of guy
isn't your type, huh?

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.290
We've only got eyes for you, Kairi!

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.290
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.620
Hurry! Hurry!

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.620
Jigoro is here again!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.060
--Look! Look!
--Where!? Where!?

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.620
Who only has eyes for me?

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.700
Yo.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.110
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.590
Incredible! What's this?

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:14.590
Your own personal seat.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:15.930
Amazing!

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:18.260
This is too good for me to sit on!

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.600
Where should we go?

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:21.930
I'm kind of hungry.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:22.930
Okay.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.630
Momo-chan!

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:29.270
Heading home now? Want a lift
to the train station?

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.610
Oh, I'm sorry. This is only a two-seater.
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.870
Just get out of here, already!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.290
Did he just glare at you?

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:49.630
You thought so too, Toji?

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:55.860
Why? lt's like l sensed some hostility
in his eyes. But that can't be right...

00:05:57.630 --> 00:06:02.570
And so, before dinner, Jigoro said he
was going to buy me a dress as a present!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.240
It's so incredible! When I'm with Jigoro,

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.910
everywhere we go,
people make a fuss over us,

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:12.250
The stores he takes me to, the people
Jigoro knows- everything is so gorgeous!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:13.850
Now that I've got a taste
for that world,

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:17.920
I don't think I could ever go back
to dating guys my age again!

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:21.260
Mm-hmm, that sure is terrific.

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:25.660
Look at this ring! He bought it
for me yesterday.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.930
It's a limited edition piece they had on TV.

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:28.930
Well?

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.700
That's nice.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:36.470
O- oh, yeah. Let's talk
about you, Momo-chan.

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:39.610
Where do you and Toji usually go on dates?

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:42.610
Just the usual places.
We date like regular people.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.620
We don't have any money, so we can't
amuse ourselves too extravagantly,

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:48.480
but as long as I'm with Toji,
anywhere we go is enjoyable.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.620
And you're content with that?

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:52.960
Of course I am.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:57.290
So you say, but really, you wish
you could go on gorgeous dates, right?

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.300
But I'm with the one I love.

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.560
Anything more than that
is no big deal, isn't it?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.570
Hey, Toji!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:10.340
You're the officer of the day, right?
The homeroom teacher is calling for you.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.590
What was that just now!?

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:24.920
J- just a little salute,
that's all, a salute.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:28.520
Liar! I can tell! It's a secret code
between you two, huh!?

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.420
"'Kiss Okay"' or something.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.260
I- it is not!

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.930
This is an L for "'Love"'!

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.270
It's a sign of our love!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.270
Yuck! I'm surprised you can bear
to do something so embarrassing.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.070
We love each other.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:51.750
Oh, man! Momo-chan,
you've got lousy taste.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.620
What's so great about Toji, anyhow?

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:56.320
Toji's the sort of guy
who didn't believe you, Momo-chan,

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:57.620
even when you were seeing him,

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.220
and instead took my side, didn't he?

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:04.230
If he were a man, he should believe
his girlfriend no matter what happens!

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.560
You're a fine one to say so.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:09.030
After all, Sae, you're the one

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.570
who manipulated Toji into believing you,
aren't you?

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:15.910
It's his own fault for being fooled!
It just goes to show the level of man he is.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.910
Now, look...

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:21.580
If Toji was the kind of guy who
believed everything I said unilaterally,

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:24.280
and just ignored you when
you started hanging on him, Sae,

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.710
I wouldn't have fallen in love with him.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:34.260
Sure, Toji can be naive, and gets
easily carried away by his feelings,

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:37.260
but everyone has their faults, don't they?

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:43.600
For my part, I've got plenty of flaws,
so how can I ask Toji to be perfect?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:48.610
Besides, after Toji realized his mistake,
he became really nice.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:53.070
He was nice before that, too, but now
it seems like he really cares about me.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:59.610
I love Toji the way he is now
much more than I ever did before.

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.880
Is that so!? Is that so!?

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.230
Sae, what about you?

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.560
What about me?

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.890
What is it about Jigoro
that you've fallen in love with?

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:20.240
This one, and that one, and that one there,
and then that one over there, all of them!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.140
Thank you very much.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.910
Come on, on to the next place.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.910
You want to keep shopping?

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.010
You said you'd buy me anything
I wanted today, didn't you!?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:35.250
Fine. If you want,
should we buy up the whole store?

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.920
More!

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:39.050
More! More!

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.820
Bring me something more expensive!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:47.630
More! More! More!

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.630
Satisfied?

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:56.610
What's wrong? You seem blue
about something today.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:10:01.610
Say, want to come up with a secret sign
for just the two of us?

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:03.280
A secret sign?

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:08.280
Yeah! Like if we make an "'L"'
with our fingers, it means "'I love you."'

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:11.450
Oh, is that what you wanted me to say?

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:15.950
That's okay, we don't have to go
to the trouble. I'll tell you everyday.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.630
It's not enough.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:24.300
This isn't enough! I don't
feel one bit satisfied!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:28.970
Why!? Right now, I'm better than her,
so why does she seem so happy!?

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:32.980
I've got everything right now,
so why does it feel like I'm losing!?

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:36.310
What does that girl have that I don't!?

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.280
What is it!?

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:41.880
Sae-chan...

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:46.420
What is it about Jigoro
that you've fallen in love with?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:54.130
I love Toji the way he is now
much more than I ever did before.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.540
I'm with the one I love.

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:01.630
Anything more than that
is no big deal, isn't it?

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:06.280
We love each other.

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:09.300
What does that girl have that I don't?

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.950
Sae-chan,

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:19.960
just what is it that you want? Tell me.
Anything I can do for you, I'll do it.

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:24.150
It won't work. You can't
give me what I want.

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.930
I really can't go out with you.

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:36.940
What I really want is Toji!

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.790
You're birthday is coming up soon,
right Adachi?

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:57.890
How about the two of us have a party?

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:02.930
Yes! Yes, yes, yes!

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:07.940
Ah, a party! Just the two of us!
A celebration!

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:14.940
l'm so happy! l didn't say anything, and yet
you still remembered my birthday, huh Toji?

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:18.470
So, about your present- what do you want?

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:23.290
If it's coming from you,
Toji, anything will be fine!

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:26.620
A fat lot of help that is.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:30.290
Anyhow, give it some thought tonight.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:33.730
Thanks for walking me home.
See you tomorrow.

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:55.320
Ee-yow!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.650
What are you doing,
you dumb dog!? Dumb dog!

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.450
S- shoo!

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.930
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:05.220
T- take care...

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.490
And here l thought
my second one was coming.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.270
l haven't made any progress
with Toji since then.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.970
What do you want?

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.340
Your love, Toji...

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.040
Yeah, right! Yeah, right! Yeah, right!

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.960
Target located.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.960
5... 4...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:37.960
3...

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:38.630
2...

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.860
1!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.300
Aah! Toji!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.310
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:51.360
Aah! Wait, Toji!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.110
Toji!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.650
Wait!

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.320
Toji! Toji, I say!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:01.780
Why are you running away!?

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.780
Would you wait up already!

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:18.570
I can understand you not
wanting to look at my face.

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:22.940
You haven't talked to me
once since 2nd Term started.

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:25.910
Are you still mad at me?

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.010
I don't have any right
to blame you, Kashiwagi.

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:34.280
Looks like you and Momo-chan
are getting along well, huh?

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:37.620
The two of you have even made
your own sign, you're so lovey-dovey.

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:40.750
I could say the same for you,
Kashiwagi, with that model guy.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.060
So it really did look that way?

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:51.970
It's not like that. He's just having me
tag along with him arbitrarily.

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:55.970
He seems to think that all girls
are interested in him.

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:58.240
Lately, I've been so desperate,

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:01.540
that I just agree immediately
to go with him wherever I'm told to.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:07.250
Do you think I'm a tramp?

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:09.120
It's only right that you would.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.190
A girl who would kiss
her friend's boyfriend,

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:17.260
saying he could practice on her,

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:20.930
and what's worse, fill his head with all
that bad stuff I said about Momo-chan...

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:24.270
I really am a lowlife.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:29.940
Still, for the life of me, Toji, I didn't
want to hand you back over to Momo-chan.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.500
No matter what dirty tricks I had to use.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.780
It's because I love you, Toji.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:47.290
Silly, isn't it? Being your practice dummy
was such an enriching experience.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:51.120
Actually, I just wanted to have
an excuse to kiss you, Toji.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:54.900
That was my first kiss.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:08.680
It's really gotten chilly, huh?
I sure hate winter.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:11.880
Winter clothes don't go
with tan skin, you know?

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.590
What's the matter?

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:19.590
Did something happen?
You seem distracted.

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.590
No...

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:22.580
Sure?

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:29.270
Ouch!

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.960
Are you okay? Here, let me see.

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:38.640
Ohh? Feels nice, feels nice.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:42.170
At this rate, there's a chance
that we'll pick up from yesterday...

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.110
Luckily, there's no sign of anyone around.

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:49.510
A- all right now...

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:55.650
T- this is embarrassing...

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.830
That was my first kiss.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.000
Ready to go home?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.240
Toji, you idiot!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:17.280
Why wouldn't you kiss me!?

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.920
What was I doing there,
completely in the mood, waiting for him!?

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:23.880
I was a complete dolt, wasn't I!?
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:28.690
Then again, Toji was acting
a little strange today.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.930
His mind was elsewhere,
even when l talked to him.

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:34.620
Have l done something
and not even known it?

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:39.040
Or did he try to kiss me,
but l had bad breath,

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.270
or a hair sticking out of my nose,
or something?

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:43.970
ls that why Toji lost the urge to kiss me?

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:48.270
Oh, nooo!!

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:58.180
"'Dear Toji, I need to talk to you.
Please come to the back courtyard. -Sae"'

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:01.560
Toji!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:04.190
You came! I'm so glad!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:09.900
I believe you understand how
I feel from what I said yesterday.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.500
I still love you Toji, even now.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.900
I tried to get over you time and again,
but it's no use.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.570
You're the only one who will do, Toji.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:21.240
Sorry. I cannot return
your feelings, Kashiwagi.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.250
Adachi is the only one I love.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:27.310
But you must have kissed me because
you have some feelings for me, right?

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.590
"'Pride"'

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:33.150
"'Pride"'
You mean, you don't think anything of me?

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.080
Sorry.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:40.930
You didn't feel anything
when you kissed me!?

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.130
You're telling me that
even while we were kissing,

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:45.940
you were only thinking of Momo-chan!?

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.940
Uh-huh.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.840
And that's just the way it is.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.440
W- what's so great about that girl!?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:00.720
The way she says she loves me,
faults and all.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:12.560
I thought this might happen,
so I laid a trap.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:16.230
Fine. I'll give up on you, Toji.

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:17.290
Here...

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.240
In return...

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:24.240
Give me one last farewell kiss!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.910
I- I can't possibly do that!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:29.250
Why not? You'd disgrace a girl?

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.910
That's what you call it, but you're just
planning to use it to blackmail me again!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:34.580
Well, we'll see about that!

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:36.210
Stop it!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.410
Cut it out already, Kashiwagi!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.690
Nice timing!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.410
He's mine.

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:13.660
Sae, what do you think you're doing?

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:18.320
"'Come to the back courtyard"'

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.360
O- oh, no, Momo-sama!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:24.970
I was just trying to make sure
how strong you and Toji's love is!

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:27.200
There's no way I would seriously
make a move for him, right?

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.640
I've got Jigoro, after all.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:33.940
Okay then, goodbye!
May you find every happiness!

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:50.990
You dummy! Why!? Why would you
kiss Sae!? You dummy! You dummy!

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:55.330
I'm sorry. I managed to defend
my lips from her, at least...

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:57.660
...but that's not what the matter is, huh?

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.670
I really am sorry.

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.950
You're not forgiven. Unless you kiss me
a whole lot more than you did Sae,

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.170
you're not forgiven.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.780
Hmph! Those two have
both gotten a lot tougher.

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:43.110
This is going to take more
than just my normal methods.

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:48.950
I'm going to need a more detailed plan.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:53.550
I mean, there are limits
to what I can do on my own.

00:21:56.990 --> 00:21:59.120
--Hey.
--What are you doing here?

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:01.930
Wait.

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:05.270
I don't care who you're in love with,
I want to get back together with you.

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:08.530
I'll give you anything that you want.

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:17.680
l think that Toji and l have
finally become true lovers.

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:23.290
Anything that I want?

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:28.310
Fine. In return,
you'll do what I ask you to?

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:42.710
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:52.380
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:55.390
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.390 --> 00:23:01.990
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:08.900
Where can we go

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:18.010
where we can all be

00:23:18.010 --> 00:23:21.310
under the same sky?

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:29.690
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:35.690
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:42.030
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:49.370
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:57.710
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.650 --> 00:24:03.720
The day is finally here! The two of us
alone with each other at night-

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:04.660
what am l going to do!?

00:24:04.660 --> 00:24:07.990
What if the mood comes upon us?

00:24:07.990 --> 00:24:11.660
Ah, Toji's kisses are so gentle!

00:24:11.660 --> 00:24:15.000
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'Pure Love Sabotage"'
